    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.160" end="00:08.160" ttm:agent="v1">空に向って走る車のライト</p>
      <p begin="00:08.640" end="00:14.260" ttm:agent="v1">あなたと寄り添えば</p>
      <p begin="00:14.260" end="00:18.710" ttm:agent="v1">流星になるのよ</p>
      <p begin="00:18.710" end="00:21.060" ttm:agent="v1">Real quick, I'ma pull up with my chick, ayy</p>
      <p begin="00:21.060" end="00:23.380" ttm:agent="v1">Whip all nice, got myself a couple chips, ayy</p>
      <p begin="00:23.380" end="00:25.160" ttm:agent="v1">Move so fast, I'ma hit you with the stick</p>
      <p begin="00:25.160" end="00:28.050" ttm:agent="v1">I'ma make a couple racks, and you steady hittin' licks, ayy</p>
      <p begin="00:28.050" end="00:29.830" ttm:agent="v1">No hoes, I'll be sellin' out shows</p>
      <p begin="00:29.830" end="00:32.240" ttm:agent="v1">See my name up in arenas, fillin' seats up by the rows</p>
      <p begin="00:32.240" end="00:35.210" ttm:agent="v1">No shit, yeah, I don't got time for no thot ass bitch, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:35.210" end="00:37.380" ttm:agent="v1">I just want you, shotgun with the clip</p>
      <p begin="00:37.380" end="00:39.150" ttm:agent="v1">Real quick, I'ma pull up with my chick, ayy</p>
      <p begin="00:39.150" end="00:41.590" ttm:agent="v1">Whip all nice, got myself a couple chips, ayy</p>
      <p begin="00:41.590" end="00:43.630" ttm:agent="v1">Move so fast, I'ma hit you with the stick</p>
      <p begin="00:43.630" end="00:46.580" ttm:agent="v1">I'ma make a couple racks, and you steady hittin' licks, ayy</p>
      <p begin="00:46.580" end="00:48.080" ttm:agent="v1">No hoes, I'll be sellin' out shows</p>
      <p begin="00:48.010" end="00:50.360" ttm:agent="v1">See my name up in arenas, fillin' seats up by the rows</p>
      <p begin="00:50.360" end="00:53.750" ttm:agent="v1">No shit, yeah, I don't got time for no thot ass bitch, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:53.750" end="00:55.250" ttm:agent="v1">I just want you, shotgun with the clip</p>
      <p begin="00:54.760" end="00:57.220" ttm:agent="v1">Goddamn, I don't fuck with no hoe</p>
      <p begin="00:57.220" end="00:59.650" ttm:agent="v1">Why they're ringing on my line, I'll be steady with the bros</p>
      <p begin="00:59.650" end="01:01.730" ttm:agent="v1">Broke boy sendin' shots while they're tippin' on their toes</p>
      <p begin="01:01.730" end="01:04.330" ttm:agent="v1">Why're they wasting all my time? All baggy with the clothes, ayy</p>
      <p begin="01:04.330" end="01:06.140" ttm:agent="v1">And I'm up right now</p>
      <p begin="01:06.140" end="01:08.300" ttm:agent="v1">Whippin' two-seater likes what's up right now, yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:08.300" end="01:10.600" ttm:agent="v1">Walk up in the club like I'm up right now</p>
      <p begin="01:10.600" end="01:12.710" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch, don't waste my time and you down right now</p>
      <p begin="01:12.710" end="01:15.120" ttm:agent="v1">I've been workin' for that guap, I've been workin' non-stop</p>
      <p begin="01:15.120" end="01:17.330" ttm:agent="v1">True shit, no bitch, got me lookin' for that wap</p>
      <p begin="01:17.330" end="01:20.190" ttm:agent="v1">Oh shit, I don't need no other hoes, I'll be selling out shows</p>
      <p begin="01:20.190" end="01:22.480" ttm:agent="v1">I've been steady makin' hits, now she's singin' all my songs</p>
      <p begin="01:22.480" end="01:24.670" ttm:agent="v1">Full clip, why you fuckers airin' me out?</p>
      <p begin="01:24.670" end="01:27.050" ttm:agent="v1">We don't got problems, why you starin' me down?</p>
      <p begin="01:27.050" end="01:30.100" ttm:agent="v1">Freak bitch, steady ridin' shotgun while they're hittin' licks, yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:30.100" end="01:32.130" ttm:agent="v1">Come out to the show, backflip die, lit</p>
      <p begin="01:32.130" end="01:34.140" ttm:agent="v1">Real quick, I'ma pull up with my chick, ayy</p>
      <p begin="01:34.140" end="01:36.460" ttm:agent="v1">Whip all nice, got myself a couple chips, ayy</p>
      <p begin="01:36.460" end="01:38.490" ttm:agent="v1">Move so fast, I'ma hit you with the stick</p>
      <p begin="01:38.490" end="01:41.180" ttm:agent="v1">I'ma make a couple racks, and you steady hittin' licks, ayy</p>
      <p begin="01:41.180" end="01:42.900" ttm:agent="v1">No hoes, I'll be sellin' out shows</p>
      <p begin="01:42.900" end="01:45.390" ttm:agent="v1">See my name up in arenas, fillin' seats up by the rows</p>
      <p begin="01:45.390" end="01:48.460" ttm:agent="v1">No shit, yeah, I don't got time for no thot ass bitch, yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:48.460" end="01:50.340" ttm:agent="v1">I just want you, shotgun with the clip</p>
      <p begin="01:50.340" end="01:52.390" ttm:agent="v1">Real quick, I'ma pull up with my chick, ayy</p>
